{"data": [{"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-11-12T04:05:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120729674170990898"], "id": "2120729674170990898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 11133, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "While SpaceX makes preparations to launch Starship Flight 15 from Starbase later this week, tonight it's set to launch a Falcon 9 rocket from Vandenber Space Force Base. Liftoff for the USSF-627 mission is set for 8:36 pm PT (11:36 pm ET / 0336 UTC).\n\nWatch live:", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2120729674170990898"}, {"author_id": "34743251", "created_at": "2026-11-12T03:47:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120725054933635188"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "SpaceX designs, manufactures and launches advanced rockets and spacecraft.", "display_url": "spacex.com/launches/ussf6…", "end": 189, "expanded_url": "https://spacex.com/launches/ussf627", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120444989834440704/b6cCqwiL?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120444989834440704/b6cCqwiL?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 166, "status": 200, "title": "SpaceX", "unwound_url": "https://www.spacex.com/launches/ussf627", "url": "https://t.co/IdlZbviZZl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/fKxyN4DIui", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2120725054933635188/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120721676270702593", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/fKxyN4DIui"}]}, "id": "2120725054933635188", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 131, "impression_count": 653524, "like_count": 5990, "quote_count": 34, "reply_count": 237, "retweet_count": 603}, "text": "All systems are looking good, and weather is favorable for liftoff. Propellant load is about to begin for Falcon 9’s launch of the USSF-627 mission from California → https://t.co/IdlZbviZZl https://t.co/fKxyN4DIui", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2120725054933635188"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-12T02:57:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120712599511732735"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/hamandcheese/s…", "end": 207, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/hamandcheese/status/2120684063472447834", "start": 184, "url": "https://t.co/5ndJ7DtzcD"}]}, "id": "2120712599511732735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 5345, "like_count": 193, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I think this actually speaks to a real reasoning failure.\n\nConditional on any one of these being true, the odds of any of the others clearly get higher!! Bad behaviors are correlated! https://t.co/5ndJ7DtzcD", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120712599511732735"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-12T02:52:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120711294571733449"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/afinetheorem/s…", "end": 199, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/afinetheorem/status/2120637890799530237", "start": 176, "url": "https://t.co/3AF3YJuWgb"}]}, "id": "2120711294571733449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 4627, "like_count": 116, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "It does matter who dies, it turns out.\n\nLarge shares of Russia’s casualties are prisoners, minorities, and other people the ethnic Russian middle class may see as undesirable. https://t.co/3AF3YJuWgb", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120711294571733449"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:29:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120630085300740503"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/EleanorOlcott/…", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/EleanorOlcott/status/2120284013231484944", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/t7IIOChv5E"}]}, "id": "2120630085300740503", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4583, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "As an aside, sort of interesting that Alice Huang has a sister. She was born in 1977, just before one-child, but after Later-Longer-Fewer was well underway, and she was born in Shanghai, where family planning campaigns were enforced.\n\nTwo girls 1970s China! https://t.co/t7IIOChv5E", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120630085300740503"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:39:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120617467441463675"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/AlexHollings52…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/AlexHollings52/status/2120551832271659311", "start": 81, "url": "https://t.co/sCOseL6eIE"}]}, "id": "2120617467441463675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 5983, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Did they ever get the guy who ratted them out?\n\nHope they put him in the ground. https://t.co/sCOseL6eIE", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120617467441463675"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:59:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120607385815539715"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/atteonthephone…", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/atteonthephone/status/2120550196170154406", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/QMlOpnM80V"}]}, "id": "2120607385815539715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2370, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "so in this case that feels like maybe the law is bad?\n\nwhy should it be illegal for some 3rd party to take the other side of an insurance deal like this? https://t.co/QMlOpnM80V", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120607385815539715"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:57:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120606908134683003"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/x8ab16BNOn", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120606908134683003/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2120606900957954048", "start": 0, "url": "https://t.co/x8ab16BNOn"}, {"display_url": "x.com/annmarie/statu…", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/annmarie/status/2120557536030212260", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/LnXeaX4aVx"}]}, "id": "2120606908134683003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1591, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/x8ab16BNOn https://t.co/LnXeaX4aVx", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120606908134683003"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:35:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120601244242788562"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "1883853671148167168", "start": 17, "username": "SecDuffy"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9TCZVt6MiN", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120601244242788562/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120601237171077120", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/9TCZVt6MiN"}]}, "id": "2120601244242788562", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1547, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Over a year ago, @SecDuffy announced that some DoT programs would consider birth and marriage rates when reviewing applications for grants.\n\nA new rule gives us details: a grant program mostly doing light rail will slightly boost scores for programs in areas with more births and https://t.co/9TCZVt6MiN", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120601244242788562"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:29:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120599804073889961"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ScottNover/sta…", "end": 132, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ScottNover/status/2120537563769487656", "start": 109, "url": "https://t.co/rstAhhTReI"}]}, "id": "2120599804073889961", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2479, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "feels like if the reason we know about this is because she properly disclosed it, this is.... not a problem? https://t.co/rstAhhTReI", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120599804073889961"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:21:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120597871498326372"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/FamStudies/sta…", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/FamStudies/status/2120592453229326570", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/5gkm5xUeg8"}]}, "id": "2120597871498326372", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2134, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Advertisers higher celebrities for ads, to endorse products, to use their products because they know one simple fact to be true:\n\nPeople buy what celebrities sell.\n\nBut the main things celebrities sell is their lifestyle. Kids are, obviously, part of that. https://t.co/5gkm5xUeg8", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120597871498326372"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:15:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120596404607619346"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jensenjeans/st…", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jensenjeans/status/2120578571035156631", "start": 86, "url": "https://t.co/gess7K7Hg8"}]}, "id": "2120596404607619346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1794, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "modafinil and cerebrolysin looking good in this thread\n\ni am adraful-curious, i admit https://t.co/gess7K7Hg8", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120596404607619346"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:04:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120593440366813196"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lefineder/stat…", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lefineder/status/2120591653769474221", "start": 151, "url": "https://t.co/N4MTaNZMjf"}]}, "id": "2120593440366813196", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 3981, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "if those convictions are valid, that plausible puts Renaissance Florence at like a 5-10% active homosexual male population, which is pretty remarkable https://t.co/N4MTaNZMjf", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120593440366813196"}, {"author_id": "34743251", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:29:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120584703082446863"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SGpSvt1dby", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2120584703082446863/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120582979651358721", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/SGpSvt1dby"}]}, "id": "2120584703082446863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 246, "impression_count": 861171, "like_count": 13896, "quote_count": 82, "reply_count": 337, "retweet_count": 1403}, "text": "Thank you to all those who have served, including the veterans we're proud to call members of the SpaceX family. Happy Veterans Day! https://t.co/SGpSvt1dby", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2120584703082446863"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:23:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120583135255576636"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Osinttechnical…", "end": 31, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Osinttechnical/status/2120552904092529007", "start": 8, "url": "https://t.co/LlgETiYPnZ"}]}, "id": "2120583135255576636", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1603, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "curious https://t.co/LlgETiYPnZ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120583135255576636"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:20:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120582504231158017"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/econcallum/sta…", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/econcallum/status/2120552445751492654", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/HuUF5rCGBS"}]}, "id": "2120582504231158017", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2994, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Russia's KIA counts today are likely near 500,000, plus some additional multiple wounded.\n\nUkraine's are actually less clear-- but sources seem to range from 150,000 to 350,000. My bias is probably in the upper part of that range. I have a hard time imagining 4:1 KIAs. https://t.co/HuUF5rCGBS", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120582504231158017"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:52:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120575384559177857"], "id": "2120575384559177857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3775, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "difficult for me to imagine anything as dumb as getting rid of the legislative filibuster when you know that in 2 months the opposing party is about to sweep in with a large majority", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120575384559177857"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:39:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120572019628544368"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/albrgr/status/…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/albrgr/status/2120342258889445382", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/WBsC0yxv9y"}]}, "id": "2120572019628544368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2647, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Effective Altruism is a movement with various strands. In my post I elected to focus on critiquing one strand of thinking with which I have a particular disagreement.\n\nI readily grant that rather recently some strands of EA have come around to thinking that makes more sense to https://t.co/WBsC0yxv9y", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120572019628544368"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:30:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120569878939595158"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "All the big news items: Papuan family planning, minivan mileage standards, Indian Supreme Court decisions, Estonian maternity wards! We’ve got it all!", "display_url": "lymanstone.substack.com/p/big-month-fo…", "end": 259, "expanded_url": "https://lymanstone.substack.com/p/big-month-for-asia-fertility-news", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120569879950471168/YmCKELxX?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120569879950471168/YmCKELxX?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 236, "status": 200, "title": "Big Month for Asia Fertility News!", "unwound_url": "https://lymanstone.substack.com/p/big-month-for-asia-fertility-news", "url": "https://t.co/aHUgduvEUO"}]}, "id": "2120569878939595158", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1080, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "In my monthly fertility news roundup I've got FUEL STANDARDS FOR MINIVANS and INDIAN SUPREME COURT CASES and ESTONIA (twice!) and CHINESE WEDDINGS and LIGHT RAIL GRANTMAKING RULES and SEVERAL CURIOUS CONDOM SUPPLY STORIES and MUCH MORE\nhttps://t.co/aHUgduvEUO", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120569878939595158"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-11-11T16:42:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120557832898855376"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ESA_Hera/statu…", "end": 40, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ESA_Hera/status/2120548661679841629", "start": 17, "url": "https://t.co/EJlcnN64zG"}]}, "id": "2120557832898855376", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 18802, "like_count": 321, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 44}, "text": "Getting closer.. https://t.co/EJlcnN64zG", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2120557832898855376"}, {"author_id": "46648807", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:37:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120526223122067854"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9bIi1SnVRl", "end": 239, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2120526223122067854/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120526214758604800", "start": 216, "url": "https://t.co/9bIi1SnVRl"}]}, "id": "2120526223122067854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1836, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Today, we recognize and honor the veterans within the NIST community and across the United States. Your commitment to our country continues to inspire our mission every day. Thank you for your service and sacrifice. https://t.co/9bIi1SnVRl", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2120526223122067854"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:16:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120521113633718602"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Astro_Eggcelen…", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Astro_Eggcelent/status/2120272911504478286", "start": 229, "url": "https://t.co/agwWRL1NbP"}]}, "id": "2120521113633718602", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 8933, "like_count": 326, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Actually, they do not have iguanas in it yet. The experiment was planned but not carried out due to funding limits.\n\nWhich is a shame, because \"Can we make mega-jumbo iguanas?\" is, in fact, an extremely cool question on its own. https://t.co/agwWRL1NbP", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120521113633718602"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:12:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120519998892359955"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/KelseyTuoc/sta…", "end": 225, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/KelseyTuoc/status/2120307722956722398", "start": 202, "url": "https://t.co/EsmEhMRbIx"}]}, "id": "2120519998892359955", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3651, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have updated the post with revisions providing additional evidence that health interventions are not good investments and that malaria interventions in particular are not particularly well-supported. https://t.co/EsmEhMRbIx", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120519998892359955"}, {"author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:42:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120512367557488949"], "id": "2120512367557488949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 11771, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "My impression is that on catastrophic AI risk, people split into two groups: those who’ve always taken it seriously, and those who never have.\n\nIf that’s not true for you, what changed your mind?\n\nWhat made you take the risks seriously?\nOr what made you less worried than you once", "url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2120512367557488949"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:16:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120506009420480561"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 44, "id": "1263380605", "start": 35, "username": "Calendly"}], "urls": [{"description": "Calendly connects and simplifies all of the work around meetings, from scheduling, payments, and meeting prep to notetaking, contact management, and follow-up.", "display_url": "calendly.com", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://calendly.com", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119065510793138176/6k820gyE?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119065510793138176/6k820gyE?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 86, "status": 200, "title": "Meeting Scheduling Software and AI Meeting Tools | Calendly", "unwound_url": "https://calendly.com", "url": "https://t.co/HPtJk6tq4s"}]}, "id": "2120506009420480561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1082, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Almost got got by a Calendly scam. @Calendly has got to crack down on this. It was an https://t.co/HPtJk6tq4s URL! But it was a fraudulent twitter account; trigger for me as A) twitter somehow saw the link as suspicious and B) it asked for access to my twitter account, which was", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2120506009420480561"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "17217640", "name": "Spaceflight Now", "username": "SpaceflightNow"}, {"id": "34743251", "name": "SpaceX", "username": "SpaceX"}, {"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "21436960", "name": "European Space Agency", "username": "esa"}, {"id": "46648807", "name": "National Institute of Standards and Technology", "username": "NIST"}, {"id": "610659001", "name": "Max Roser", "username": "MaxCRoser"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2120729674170990898", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovc8h05ahkgqlpum24x6yz96anx", "oldest_id": "2120506009420480561", "result_count": 25}}
